{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"Baeshra nods. \"Baeshra think so. Baeshra like spend time with Lunar. Lunar good friend. \"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:02:23.123000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744481171693371413","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"If we hunt again, I will watch you next. Perhaps then I can see how to help you.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:03:21.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744481416775073853","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Baeshra like this.\" Baeshra nods. \"Prey here much different. Much more strong than were Baeshra come from. Make sense why Baeshra feel not good hunter here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:04:53.518000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744481802495852657","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Cryptid are allowed to grow here. Those who stay become strong. I can tell the magic of the island has already caused you to grow stronger. I can smell that you have gotten more powerful in mere weeks.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:07:03.765000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744482348791496754","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"(In game reason to explain why people level up)","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:07:17.553000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744482406622298222","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Baeshra feel it. Baeshra much more than when leave London. But long way to go be strong like Lunar.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:08:42.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744482763176149052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"There are few like me. Few as strong or as fast or as smart. But it is being smart that I value the most. Understanding brings food to my children and wise Huntress to my den.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:10:16.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744483157142798438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"Baeshra nods. \"Much smart. Baeshra much happy to learn from. \"Lunar have many younglings?\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:11:50.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744483551206047777","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Three now. Others who have grown. They are me. And I am their mother. I am parthenogenic.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:14:43.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744484278745694228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Part-o-what?\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:15:30.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744484476268183573","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"It means that all Tazlewurms are girls. When we lay eggs we pass on our memories. As I received the memories of my mother. We don't breed. We make our young as copies of ourselves.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:17:14.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744484911116976128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Much wierd... Lunar still same Lunar from day before?\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:19:13.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744485410041888778","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"\"Yes. I am the same. Our life cycle isn't long, but we live on in your young.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:19:45.684000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744485544511406090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"733827435103125594","content":"Baeshra nods. \"Baeshra be friend long with Lunar now. And other Lunar to come.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T09:21:20.588000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744485942567501834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
